1. Added imports for necessary provider components
2. Created instances for QueryClient and i18next
3. Added mock implementations for TRPCProvider, FeatureProvider, and SessionProvider
4. Wrapped the ImportedComponent with all the required providers in the correct order based on the error stack trace
5. Kept the existing mocks for getTranslate, SettingsHeader, and FlagListingView

